<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 11:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>印度央行加强黄金贷款审查，金价暴跌信号紧张</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/rbi-steps-up-gold-loan-scrutiny-as-bullion-rout-signals-strain</link><description>据知情人士透露，印度银行监管机构正在加强对该国 2470 亿美元黄金贷款行业的审查，因为金条价格大幅下跌削弱了贷方向借款人索取的抵押品。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/rbi-steps-up-gold-loan-scrutiny-as-bullion-rout-signals-strain'&gt;印度央行加强黄金贷款审查，金价暴跌信号紧张&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：RBI Steps Up Gold Loan Scrutiny as Bullion Rout Signals Strain&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/rbi-steps-up-gold-loan-scrutiny-as-bullion-rout-signals-strain</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:39:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着谈判取得进展，艾森科特更接近领导以色列</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/eisenkot-edging-closer-to-leading-israel-with-talks-progressing</link><description>距离大选只剩下一周多的时间，加迪·艾森科特距离联盟的突破已经很近了，这可以确保他获得议会多数席位，并放松本杰明·内塔尼亚胡对以色列政治长达三年的控制。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/eisenkot-edging-closer-to-leading-israel-with-talks-progressing'&gt;随着谈判取得进展，艾森科特更接近领导以色列&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Eisenkot Edging Closer to Leading Israel With Talks Progressing&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/eisenkot-edging-closer-to-leading-israel-with-talks-progressing</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>燃油价格暴跌为司机和央行带来缓解</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/plunging-fuel-prices-bring-relief-for-drivers-and-central-banks</link><description>在短短几周内，全球燃料市场已经摆脱了危机，至少目前是这样。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/plunging-fuel-prices-bring-relief-for-drivers-and-central-banks'&gt;燃油价格暴跌为司机和央行带来缓解&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Plunging Fuel Prices Bring Relief for Drivers and Central Banks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/plunging-fuel-prices-bring-relief-for-drivers-and-central-banks</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>挪威财富基金再次投票否决马斯克的特斯拉薪酬计划</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/norway-s-wealth-fund-again-votes-no-to-musk-s-tesla-pay-package</link><description>挪威规模达 2.2 万亿美元的主权财富基金表示，将在下周特斯拉公司年会上投票反对埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 的 2025 年薪酬方案。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/norway-s-wealth-fund-again-votes-no-to-musk-s-tesla-pay-package'&gt;挪威财富基金再次投票否决马斯克的特斯拉薪酬计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Norway’s Wealth Fund Again Votes No to Musk’s Tesla Pay Package&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/norway-s-wealth-fund-again-votes-no-to-musk-s-tesla-pay-package</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:15:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>莫迪接近增加印度议会席位所需的多数票</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/modi-nears-majority-needed-to-increase-india-s-parliament-seats</link><description>在地区反对党宣布支持一项有争议的扩大印度议会规模的法律后，总理纳伦德拉·莫迪的政府距离批准该法案又近了一步。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/modi-nears-majority-needed-to-increase-india-s-parliament-seats'&gt;莫迪接近增加印度议会席位所需的多数票&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Modi Nears Majority Needed to Increase India’s Parliament Seats&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/modi-nears-majority-needed-to-increase-india-s-parliament-seats</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:17:39 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>